  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Mekong River Commission and Mekong governments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment comprises activities to support Mekong governments manage water resources. Australia&#x2019;s support includes contribution to the Mekong River Commission (MRC), World Bank, Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research (ACIAR). Specific support includes 1) support to the MRC to implement its Strategic Plan 2016-2020 and improve its data, modelling and knowledge management system, 2) support to the World Bank to implement its Mekong Integrated Water Resources Management Program, and 3) support to ACIAR to assess fish passage facilities at Xayaburi dam in Laos. This multi-year investment concluded on 30 June 2022 with Australia&#x2019;s water resource management support continuing through new investments.</narrative>
  </description>
